WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.940
The European Union proposed rules shielding hundreds of millions of online shoppers from deceptive designs and hidden influencer promotions. This is Omni View, episode 233, Akra's open dump, a prison hospital transfer in Pakistan, and an impeachment petition in Jakarta come next, then how a Brussels draft becomes national law. Draft legislation from the European Commission, the Union's executive body, which puts forward laws for the block, would, in the Wall Street Journal's account, ban certain

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.980
Deceptive website designs require clearer disclosure from influencers who promote products

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:41.200
online and set limits on how companies use artificial intelligence or AI to target consumers.

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:46.600
The measures update existing consumer protection laws so they cover digital platforms more

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:52.200
directly, and officials said the changes respond to complaints about hidden fees, dark patterns

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:56.880
that steer purchases through the design of a page, and unclear advertising that does

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:58.680
not announce itself as advertising.

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:04.200
The tech's name specific practices that consumer agencies have already documented on large

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:09.100
marketplaces and social platforms, and it sets out enforcement mechanisms that member

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:14.420
states, the countries inside the EU, would apply once the rules become national law.

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:19.800
Gaps have grown since the last major update to those consumer rules, and the draft is

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:24.900
pointed at practices already common on large marketplaces and social platforms, with

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:29.460
With the emphasis on practical reach across the block's single market, the shared trading

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:33.980
area of the member countries, rather than on political debate over the measures themselves.

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:39.420
The draft sits in a sequence that begins with commission consultation and then moves to

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:44.440
the European Parliament, the Union's elected legislature, and the council, where national

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:49.600
government sit, for amendments, and that sequence determines how quickly any final obligations

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:50.740
would reach shoppers.

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:57.243
Acra, Ghana's capital, still has a large open dump that, in onsite reporting from France

00:01:57.243 --> 00:02:01.883
24, continues to release smoke and polluted water into surrounding neighborhoods.

00:02:02.563 --> 00:02:07.103
Local authorities have deployed excavators to move smoldering rubbish, yet that work

00:02:07.103 --> 00:02:11.223
has not stopped residents from reporting ongoing health complaints linked to the site.

00:02:11.843 --> 00:02:16.743
Thin plumes of black smoke rise from burning plastic and rubber, while stagnant lagoon

00:02:16.743 --> 00:02:22.083
water adds to the odor and excavators work amid the haze as the rank smell reaches nearby

00:02:22.083 --> 00:02:27.243
homes. The site sits in a fast-growing city where moving waste elsewhere remains difficult

00:02:27.243 --> 00:02:32.463
and that difficulty is why the dump is treated as both an immediate public health concern for people

00:02:32.463 --> 00:02:38.563
living closest who face daily exposure and a longer-term environmental problem for the lagoon area

00:02:38.563 --> 00:02:44.123
nearby. The visible smoke and the polluted water are connected to those health complaints without

00:02:44.123 --> 00:02:47.603
without final responsibility being assigned for a long-term solution.

00:02:48.628 --> 00:02:53.508
Imran Khan's party demanded in a statement carried by Al Jazeera that family members

00:02:53.508 --> 00:02:57.828
and personal doctors be allowed to visit him after he was taken overnight from prison

00:02:57.828 --> 00:03:01.968
to a government hospital for an eye injection and then returned to his cell.

00:03:02.568 --> 00:03:06.928
Everything turns on whether that overnight move was a routine transfer under a specialist

00:03:06.928 --> 00:03:11.928
advice or a failure to tell his own party that a jailed former prime minister had left

00:03:11.928 --> 00:03:12.468
his cell.

00:03:12.468 --> 00:03:17.568
The hospital stated his condition was stable and that the visit followed advice from his

00:03:17.568 --> 00:03:23.428
ophthalmologist, and Kahn received an intra-vitrile injection, a shot into the eye, in his right

00:03:23.428 --> 00:03:28.288
eye to treat central retinal vein occlusion, a blockage in a vein at the back of the eye.

00:03:28.788 --> 00:03:33.608
The party learned of the visit from news reports rather than official notification, and it said

00:03:33.608 --> 00:03:37.048
the episode raises questions about medical transparency and access.

00:03:37.048 --> 00:03:43.308
us. Khan has been held since 2023 on corruption charges he rejects, and the government has consistently

00:03:43.308 --> 00:03:48.408
denied political motivation in the case. The hospital recorded normal vital parameters

00:03:48.408 --> 00:03:53.028
and clinical stability at discharge around 2.30 in the morning, and the party called

00:03:53.028 --> 00:03:59.561
for unrestricted access by family, personal doctors, and his legal team. Indonesian lawmakers

00:03:59.561 --> 00:04:04.341
have signed a petition calling for proceedings against the vice president, the country's second

00:04:04.341 --> 00:04:09.141
highest office, which Reuters presents as a procedural signal inside the legislature

00:04:09.141 --> 00:04:11.261
rather than an immediate change in government.

00:04:11.801 --> 00:04:15.921
More than 100 members of the parliament put their names to the document after recent

00:04:15.921 --> 00:04:20.441
political tensions, account that marks how much of the chamber is willing to sign while

00:04:20.441 --> 00:04:22.361
still leaving office holders in place.

00:04:22.901 --> 00:04:27.941
The move has not yet triggered formal removal steps, because under Indonesian rules, a threshold

00:04:27.941 --> 00:04:31.001
still has to be met before any further action can start.

00:04:31.001 --> 00:04:37.441
That sequence of parliamentary procedures would need additional votes before a formal removal process could even begin.

00:04:37.941 --> 00:04:43.421
So the petition records internal legislative pressure without any immediate change in the government's composition.

00:04:44.444 --> 00:04:52.344
Arsolick, Turkey's largest maker of white goods, household appliances such as fridges and washing machines said in an assessment carried by Bloomberg,

00:04:52.864 --> 00:04:58.144
that upcoming European Union import standards will favor its factories over some Chinese competitors.

00:04:58.144 --> 00:05:03.624
The reason it gives is that its plants already meet higher environmental and labor requirements,

00:05:04.044 --> 00:05:08.764
so money already spent on compliance can translate into market position once the standards

00:05:08.764 --> 00:05:09.444
take effect.

00:05:10.064 --> 00:05:14.964
Turkish exporters will still face new paperwork when those standards arrive, and the company

00:05:14.964 --> 00:05:19.424
treats that extra administration as part of the shift, rather than a reason the rules

00:05:19.424 --> 00:05:20.204
do not matter.

00:05:20.684 --> 00:05:25.564
Its factories in that view already satisfy the stricter criteria that will apply to imports.

00:05:25.564 --> 00:05:30.814
price-pressure from domestic manufacturers in China, the world's largest car market,

00:05:31.334 --> 00:05:36.414
is what CNBC linked to Nissan cutting its annual sales forecast for a second time this year.

00:05:37.074 --> 00:05:41.694
Nissan described plans to improve its product range and its pricing in order to compete in

00:05:41.694 --> 00:05:46.594
that market, and it tied the second downgrade directly to intensifying price-pressure from

00:05:46.594 --> 00:05:51.674
those Chinese manufacturers. The reporting centers on the company's stated need to accelerate

00:05:51.674 --> 00:05:57.434
model updates, rather than on broader industry trends, with product range and pricing adjustments

00:05:57.434 --> 00:06:03.235
as the immediate response to the revised outlook. Transposition into national law is what's

00:06:03.235 --> 00:06:07.935
actually being done after a consumer draft is approved, and the published text includes

00:06:07.935 --> 00:06:13.195
a timeline for that step once the two chambers have signed off. That path runs from draft

00:06:13.195 --> 00:06:18.335
publication through a two chamber legislative process to eventual national implementation,

00:06:18.335 --> 00:06:26.515
which is when enforcement would sit with each country and the proposal builds on earlier digital service rules rather than starting from a blank page.

